<title>USA: Victaulic Co says buys John Boyle &amp; Co division.</title>
<headline>Victaulic Co says buys John Boyle &amp; Co division.</headline>
<dateline>LEHIGH VALLEY, Pa. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Victaulic Co of America said Monday it acquired the Aquamine division of John Boyle &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>The company declined to disclose the purchase price. Victaulic Co of America and John Boyle &amp; Co are both privately-held companies.</p>
<p>Victaulic said a new company will operate as Aquamine LLC, a separate entity under the Victaulic corporate umbrella.</p>
</text>
